---
import GlyphIcon from './GlyphIcon.astro';
import ArrowIcon from '../components/ArrowIcon.astro';
import CookieArt from './CookieArt.astro';
import Icon from './HomeIcon.astro';
// Cloudflare's Request metadata is trusted edge context; never use a URL parameter or browser GPS.
const cf=(Astro.request as Request & {cf?:{country?:string}}).cf;
const country=typeof cf?.country==='string'&&/^[A-Z]{2}$/.test(cf.country)?cf.country:'unknown';
---
<section class="jc-storage-notice" data-storage-notice data-country={country} aria-labelledby="jc-notice-title" hidden><CookieArt/><div class="jc-storage-copy"><span class="jc-storage-eyebrow">YOUR PRIVACY, IN THE PICTURE</span><h2 id="jc-notice-title">A few essentials. More peace of mind.</h2><p>We use essential storage to keep your creative space secure and save the work you choose to keep. No advertising or analytics cookies are added by this app. <a href="/cookies/">See how it works</a></p></div><div class="jc-storage-actions"><button type="button" data-storage-accept><span class="jc-cookie-button-icon" aria-hidden="true"><GlyphIcon name="privacy" size={20}/></span><b>Accept essential storage</b><span class="jc-cookie-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><ArrowIcon kind="diagonal" size={18}/></span></button><button type="button" data-storage-settings><span class="jc-cookie-button-icon" aria-hidden="true"><GlyphIcon name="settings" size={20}/></span><b>My cookie settings</b></button></div></section>
<dialog class="jc-storage-dialog" data-storage-dialog aria-labelledby="jc-storage-title"><div class="jc-storage-dialog-top"><CookieArt/><button type="button" data-storage-close aria-label="Close cookie settings"><Icon name="close" size={20}/></button></div><p class="support-kicker">CLEAR CHOICES</p><h2 id="jc-storage-title">Cookies & your creative space</h2><p>Only essential services and the saves you request are active. There are no optional advertising or analytics categories to switch on.</p><div class="jc-storage-category"><div><strong>Security & notice choices</strong><span>Session access and remembering this notice.</span></div><b>Essential</b></div><div class="jc-storage-category"><div><strong>Your artwork & boards</strong><span>Stored in this browser when you save and organize.</span></div><b>You control</b></div><div class="jc-storage-category"><div><strong>Advertising & audience analytics</strong><span>The current application does not use them.</span></div><b>Not used</b></div><p class="jc-storage-warning">Clearing site data can remove saved artwork. Download an editable backup first. Confirming this notice does not clear your work.</p><p data-storage-choice role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="jc-storage-actions"><button type="button" data-storage-accept>Keep essential-only storage <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span></button><a href="/cookies/">Full storage details <ArrowIcon kind="diagonal" size={18}/></a><button type="button" data-storage-review>Review the storage notice</button></div></dialog>
<script>import {mountStorageNotice} from '../privacy/controller';mountStorageNotice();</script>
